<title>EGYPT: Egyptian pound overnight, one-week rates rise.</title>
<headline>Egyptian pound overnight, one-week rates rise.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound rose on Sunday to between 10 1/8 and 10 1/4 percent in a moderate market from Thursday's range of 9 3/4 and 10 1/16 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said one-week overnight lending rates also rose to 10 3/8 and 10 5/16 percent from 10 3/16 and 10 1/4 percent on Thursday.</p>
<p>Public-sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
